{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 39, :comments ["<b>A talent of pure gold.</b> That its weight with all its vessels be no more and no less than a talent (Menachot 8). And the profane talent is sixty maneh, and the sacred one was doubled — 120 maneh. And the maneh is the litra with which silver is weighed by the weight of Kolonya; and they are one hundred gold pieces — twenty-five selas, and the sela is four gold pieces."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:54:35.670874720Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}